Apple first introduced the idea of a smarter version of <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/siri/">Siri</a> at the 2024 Worldwide Developers Conference. &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; with <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-intelligence/">Apple Intelligence</a> was supposed to launch as part of iOS 18, but the underlying architecture wasn't good enough, and Apple was forced to delay the feature. We're now expecting a new version of &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; in <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ios-27/">iOS 27</a> with some long-awaited smarts.<br/>
<br/>
